## Sync Visual ↔ List selection in Mapping Studio

Context: Selecting an entity or relationship in Mapping → Visual only
highlighted the canvas; the List tree stayed unselected. Selecting in List
opened the shared panel but did not highlight the Visual node/link. Users
expect both views to show the same selection.

Changes:
1. src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-design.js
   Added `highlightMappingMapSelection`, `highlightMappingListSelection` and
   `syncMappingSelection`. `openEntityMappingFromDesign` /
   `openRelationshipMappingFromDesign` now call `syncMappingSelection` so
   both Visual and List stay in sync regardless of which view was clicked.
   After a Visual redraw, and when switching back to the Visual or List tab,
   the open panel's selection is restored.
