## Pattern save: catalog and cardinalities only

Context:
Auto-save after Detect copied every member of every pattern into
`graph_pattern_saved_<slug>`, duplicating `shape_json` / `diagram_json` on
each member row and rescanning shape edges once per pattern. On mid-size
domains that made the Save step dominate wall-clock for no display benefit:
the list and details pages only need the pattern catalog, support counts and
diagrams.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/graph_analysis/pattern/SavedPatternStore.py
   Save writes **one row per pattern** in a single `INSERT … UNION ALL`
   (KPIs, support, seed label, shape tokens, diagram). Metrics map and
   summary are read once. Members are no longer copied; `members()` pages
   from the live Detect output while that run is current, and still pages
   legacy member-row snapshots from the saved table. `list_saved` /
   `patterns` aggregate by `(saved_id, pattern_id)` so both schemas share
   the same size = sum(support) semantics.
2. tests/units/core/test_saved_pattern_store.py
   Expect catalog rows (not members), a single INSERT, members from Detect,
   legacy member-row paging, and catalog survival after Detect wipe.
3. src/front/static/intelligence/js/intelligence-patterns.js
   Saved-run subtitle and comments describe catalog + diagrams, not member
   snapshots.
4. src/front/templates/partials/intelligence/_intel_patterns_saved.html
   Help text: save stores cardinalities and diagrams, not every member row.
5. src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py
   Task step label: "Saving pattern catalog".
6. docs/architecture.md, docs/user-guide.md,
   docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-13-pattern-detection-design.md,
   docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-16-pattern-forward-only-design.md
   Document catalog-only Save and the members fallback.

Behaviour changes:
- New saves are O(patterns), not O(members × patterns).
- Matching entities on a saved run follow the live Detect output; after a
  new Detect they may be empty for older saves. Catalog, KPIs and diagrams
  stay frozen.
- Legacy member-row saves keep working.

