## Date and time display: YYYY/MM/DD HH:MM:SS across the UI

Context:
Dates and times were displayed inconsistently. The Versions card showed raw
Python ISO-8601 strings for "last update" and "last build"
(e.g. `2026-11-05T07:36:01.730419+00:00`), other screens used browser locale
formats (`toLocaleString`, `toLocaleDateString`, `toLocaleTimeString`), and the
