Customer``. The second edge does not exist in the ontology: it was produced by
the old bidirectional walk stepping back through a Contract shared by two
customers. Forward-only walks already fix this in the job code; a regression
test locks the shared-contract case. The fix only appears in Detect results
after the pattern job is redeployed to Databricks.

